[center][size=5][b][color=#fcee0a]An animation director for Cyberpunk 2077, in VS Code.[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[center]Design and stitch animations and acting sequences for the game's characters, then play them in the running game.[/center]
[center][/center]
[center][size=3]One of the VS Code tools from the Edgemodders community. They all work together, with optional AI assistants.[/size][/center]
[line]

[quote][size=4][b][color=#fcee0a](STATUS)[/color][/b][/size]
[b]This is not a game mod.[/b] It is an extension for VS Code, so install it there (steps below), not with Vortex.[/quote]

(SCREENSHOT: the director with a sequence open)

